 747          *
 748          * Summary:
 749          * Enables or disables the analog pumps feeding analog routing switches.
 750          * Intended to be called at startup, based on the Vdda system configuration;
 751          * may be called during operation when the user informs us that the Vdda voltage
 752          * crossed the pump threshold.
 753          *
 754          * Parameters:
 755          *  enabled - 1 to enable the pumps, 0 to disable the pumps
 756          *
 757          * Return:
